        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> to <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The troop lashes out with its bone and flesh to bludgeon and tear at any enemies within @Template[type:emanation|distance:5]{5 feet} (@Check[type:reflex|dc:27|basic:true] save). The damage depends on the number of actions.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1 </span>@Damage[(3d8+9)[bludgeoning]]</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2 </span>@Damage[(3d8+13)[bludgeoning]] </p>"
        },
