        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The lurching troop reaches out to grab thir foes and drag them to their graves. Each enemy within @Template[type:emanation|distance:5]{5 feet} must succeed at a @Check[type:reflex|dc:27] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} by the lurching troop (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>Lurching troops are concidered to have maintained @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.PMbdMWc2QroouFGD]{Grapple} each turn. All creatures that a lurching troop have grabbed when an HP threshold is hit are concidered to have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escaped}.</p>"
        },
